  "ruleText": "Den 101.16 “Graduate dental assistant” means a dental assistant who has graduated from a Commission on Dental Accreditation (CODA) accredited school of dental assisting.\n\nSource. #12427, eff 12-6-17; renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.13)",
